				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0c1bd6b elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="0c1bd6b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img decoding="async" width="2880" height="1677" src="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/diverse-experience-v5.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-4499" alt="" srcset="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/diverse-experience-v5.png 2880w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/diverse-experience-v5-300x175.png 300w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/diverse-experience-v5-1024x596.png 1024w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/diverse-experience-v5-768x447.png 768w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/diverse-experience-v5-1536x894.png 1536w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/diverse-experience-v5-2048x1193.png 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 2880px) 100vw, 2880px" />															</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3c814fb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="3c814fb" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-55c27ec e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="55c27ec" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-aa484d8 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="aa484d8" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Award-winning company</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5d99471 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="5d99471" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									DriveWealth was recognized on <a class="css-1rn59kg" title="https://www.drivewealth.com/2024/07/drivewealth-named-to-cnbc-worlds-top-fintech-companies-2024-list/" href="https://www.drivewealth.com/2024/07/drivewealth-named-to-cnbc-worlds-top-fintech-companies-2024-list/" data-testid="link-with-safety" data-renderer-mark="true"><u data-renderer-mark="true">CNBC’s 2024 “World’s Top FinTech Companies,&#8221;</u></a> is a <a class="css-1rn59kg" title="https://www.drivewealth.com/2024/04/wealthtech-100-names-drivewealth-a-2024-top-technology-innovator/" href="https://www.drivewealth.com/2024/04/wealthtech-100-names-drivewealth-a-2024-top-technology-innovator/" data-testid="link-with-safety" data-renderer-mark="true"><u data-renderer-mark="true">2024 WealthTech 100</u></a> company and was named to the <a class="css-1rn59kg" title="https://www.drivewealth.com/2022/11/the-2022-deloitte-technology-fast-500-drivewealth-recognized-as-one-of-north-americas-fastest-growing-companies/" href="https://www.drivewealth.com/2022/11/the-2022-deloitte-technology-fast-500-drivewealth-recognized-as-one-of-north-americas-fastest-growing-companies/" data-testid="link-with-safety" data-renderer-mark="true"><u data-renderer-mark="true">2022 Deloitte Technology Fast 500</u></a> ranking, the <a class="css-1rn59kg" title="https://www.drivewealth.com/2022/06/the-2022-forbes-fintech-50-list-drivewealth-recognized-as-a-global-leader/" href="https://www.drivewealth.com/2022/06/the-2022-forbes-fintech-50-list-drivewealth-recognized-as-a-global-leader/" data-testid="link-with-safety" data-renderer-mark="true"><u data-renderer-mark="true">2022 Forbes Fintech 50 List</u></a>, the <a class="css-1rn59kg" title="https://www.drivewealth.com/2022/10/drivewealth-named-to-the-2022-cb-insights-fintech-250-for-the-second-consecutive-year%ef%bf%bc/" href="https://www.drivewealth.com/2022/10/drivewealth-named-to-the-2022-cb-insights-fintech-250-for-the-second-consecutive-year%ef%bf%bc/" data-testid="link-with-safety" data-renderer-mark="true"><u data-renderer-mark="true">CB Insights Fintech 250</u></a> for the second consecutive year, and the <a class="css-1rn59kg" title="https://www.drivewealth.com/2022/04/the-wealthtech100-drivewealth-is-helping-to-drive-the-future-of-investing/" href="https://www.drivewealth.com/2022/04/the-wealthtech100-drivewealth-is-helping-to-drive-the-future-of-investing/" data-testid="link-with-safety" data-renderer-mark="true"><u data-renderer-mark="true">WealthTech 100</u></a>, in addition to receiving a <a class="css-1rn59kg" title="https://www.drivewealth.com/2022/12/benzinga-global-fintech-awards-2022-drivewealth-named-as-best-trading-technology/" href="https://www.drivewealth.com/2022/12/benzinga-global-fintech-awards-2022-drivewealth-named-as-best-trading-technology/" data-testid="link-with-safety" data-renderer-mark="true"><u data-renderer-mark="true">Benzinga 2022 Global Fintech Award</u></a>, among others.								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-84f9b8e elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="84f9b8e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Built In honored DriveWealth in its Best Places To Work Awards as one of its Best Midsize Companies to Work For and Best Paying Companies in New York City for the second consecutive year.&nbsp;</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
