		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ba47e64 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="ba47e64" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d26b11c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="d26b11c" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-686bdc0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="686bdc0" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b16dba7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="b16dba7" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<p class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Our Vision</p>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ef47f55 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="ef47f55" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">DriveWealth believes that everyone should have the ability to control their financial future.</h3>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ffaff8e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="ffaff8e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>We accomplish this by providing Partners with an API-based financial services technology platform that allows their clients around the world to trade and invest from their phone.<br /><br />Democratizing access to financial independence is at the heart of DriveWealth’s mission. Even the smallest investor can benefit from the power of portfolio diversification and long-term compounding given the opportunity.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f63335e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="f63335e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1018" height="981" src="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/our-vision-v4.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-4533" alt="" srcset="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/our-vision-v4.png 1018w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/our-vision-v4-300x289.png 300w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/our-vision-v4-768x740.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1018px) 100vw, 1018px" />															</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1c6c90e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="1c6c90e" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b0ee07c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="b0ee07c" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bfba0c2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="bfba0c2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<p class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Our Culture</p>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d018b7b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="d018b7b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">DriveWealth blends the pace and opportunity of a tech start-up with the impact, stability, and significance of Wall Street.  </h3>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c39d735 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="c39d735" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Our culture draws from the best of both worlds to mix innovation and experimentation with institutional grade execution and regulatory compliance.<br /><br />We believe that diversity and inclusion are vital as we scale and grow as a company. We celebrate our employees for embracing, respecting, and valuing the unique differences of their peers.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4ba922b elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="4ba922b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1078" height="929" src="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/culture-api-v2.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-4531" alt="" srcset="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/culture-api-v2.png 1078w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/culture-api-v2-300x259.png 300w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/culture-api-v2-1024x882.png 1024w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/culture-api-v2-768x662.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1078px) 100vw, 1078px" />															</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2dc67d9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="2dc67d9" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f95f731 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="f95f731" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-973b404 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="973b404" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e13984a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="e13984a" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f8381b1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="f8381b1" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Our leadership team</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d5916e6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="d5916e6" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>At DriveWealth, we have assembled a team of innovative, experienced, and passionate senior leaders.  The diversity of their credentials includes successful entrepreneurs, senior executives from major financial institutions, FINRA regulators, PhDs, tech innovators, and former military officers. Our senior leaders value expertise and drive and, therefore, seek to embed that same level of impressive talent across our organization.<br /><br />We are looking for enthusiastic professionals who bring a diversity of thought and experience to help us power leading fintechs and forward-looking institutions with our Brokerage-as-a-Service platform.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-fd13026 elementor-align-start elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list" data-id="fd13026" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" aria-label="Learn more about our team" data-widget_type="icon-list.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<ul class="elementor-icon-list-items">
