		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-19578dc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="19578dc" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" id="testimonial-container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7b36723 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="7b36723" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-586e2d5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="586e2d5" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1d08d07 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="1d08d07" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Hear what it means to be part of the DriveWealth team</h3>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-469bff8 elementor-testimonial--align-left elementor-testimonial--skin-default elementor-testimonial--layout-image_inline elementor-arrows-yes elementor-widget elementor-widget-testimonial-carousel" data-id="469bff8" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" id="testimonialSlider" data-settings="{&quot;slides_per_view&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;slides_to_scroll&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;space_between&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:0,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;show_arrows&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;speed&quot;:500,&quot;space_between_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;space_between_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}" data-widget_type="testimonial-carousel.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-swiper">
					<div class="elementor-main-swiper swiper" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Slides">
				<div class="swiper-wrapper">
											<div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						“Since day one, I’ve been so impressed by the depth of expertise across DriveWealth’s teams whether in technology, institutional and retail brokerage operations, on regulatory and compliance matters, and within my own legal team. Tapping these resources has always been easy because everyone is approachable, willing to teach and help where needed, and just get the job done to deliver cutting-edge (and compliant) services to our clients.”					</div>
									</div>
						<div class="elementor-testimonial__footer">
								<cite class="elementor-testimonial__cite"><span class="elementor-testimonial__name">Tim</span><span class="elementor-testimonial__title">Senior Counsel</span></cite>			</div>
		</div>
								</div>
											<div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						“Everyone on the team is super knowledgeable and helpful. The culture is great and encourages each team member to learn and grow. The problems to solve are interesting and technically challenging.”					</div>
									</div>
						<div class="elementor-testimonial__footer">
								<cite class="elementor-testimonial__cite"><span class="elementor-testimonial__name">Chenrui</span><span class="elementor-testimonial__title">Software Engineer</span></cite>			</div>
		</div>
								</div>
									</div>
