						<div class="elementor-icon-box-content">

									<h3 class="elementor-icon-box-title">
						<span  >
							Vacation &amp; time off						</span>
					</h3>
				
									<p class="elementor-icon-box-description">
						To build a successful organization, employees need time away to rest and recharge, so we provide paid time off including paid holidays and unlimited vacation time. We also strongly believe in work-life balance and, therefore, offer fully remote and hybrid work positions based on role requirements.					</p>
				
