						<div class="elementor-icon-box-content">

									<h3 class="elementor-icon-box-title">
						<span  >
							Compensation &amp; equity						</span>
					</h3>
				
									<p class="elementor-icon-box-description">
						Ensuring your contributions are fully recognized is important. Therefore, we built our compensation package across three pillars: salary, incentive pay, and stock equity offerings. This ensures your compensation rewards you today and aligns your incentives with the company’s long-term growth.					</p>
				
